message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "canopy-collapse-news-2024-2025: Serbian online news, 1 November 2024 – 30 April 2025, with a validated scope layer for the Novi Sad canopy collapse and the protest movement"
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-09
authors:
  - family-names: Nikolić
    given-names: Ratko
repository-code: "https://github.com/RatkoNikolic/canopy-collapse-news-2024-2025"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - Serbia
  - news
  - media
  - protests
  - Novi Sad
  - canopy collapse
  - dataset
  - provenance
abstract: >-
  All news articles from nine Serbian online outlets (Blic, Danas, Informer, RTS, B92, Pink, N1,
  Telegraf, Nova) published 1 November 2024 – 30 April 2025, as a verifiable index (URLs, dates,
  sha256 of page and text; no article text), with a scope layer marking the 43,611 articles about
  the collapse of the Novi Sad railway-station canopy and the protest movement that followed.
  The scope layer is validated against a pre-registered gold set of 300 articles labelled by
  three coders: precision 0.846, recall 0.954.
